[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18964.708, "timestamp": "05:16:04", "text": "你先做猶太人，然後是無底洞。  猶太人優先，無底洞。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18966.55, "timestamp": "05:16:06", "text": "好的，沒錯。  在底部。  整體來說，結果令人滿意。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18969.59, "timestamp": "05:16:09", "text": "，這和這個不一樣，我們來寫下來吧。  兒子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18976.55, "timestamp": "05:16:16", "text": "打哈欠去搖滾娜娜愛Q尺。  S man yan nani ni 好可愛好可愛 He mi my again.一遍又一遍地切換。  我的天哪，我居然全答對了。我的天啊。  [笑聲] [倒抽一口氣] 真不錯。等等，我好像全答對了。我覺得再次往右看是正確的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18995.35, "timestamp": "05:16:35", "text": "。然後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18997.35, "timestamp": "05:16:37", "text": "就像我沒有……呃……密鑰，我正確地寫了密鑰，下一個。  它就像《半條命》的標誌。  ["}, {"type": "chat", "time": 19003.47, "timestamp": "05:16:43", "author": "@FEROCIOUS_Grrr", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/b2fcSyaRaGAEUJaW8yBs5ibxfiDi-brp1G8cHHTYAXKaRusaeuWU68kOjIUNWz1gmVNNSGP5MQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/face-purple-rain-drops"}]